00:022:18.000 --> 00:022:21.000
And debate it with your companion, your jinn.

00:022:23.000 --> 00:022:29.000
We're all advocating the worship of God alone, upholding the Word of God alone. We can't go wrong.

00:022:29.000 --> 00:022:34.000
The Quran repeats that the only unforgivable offense in the Quran is idol worship.

00:022:34.000 --> 00:022:40.000
